Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have one question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of lunatic\Nadopts a water monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well there, don't call her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not a monster, she's\Nmy baby and my familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit I was frightened of\Nthe creature at first too,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's actually quite\Na docile little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Docile monsters do not exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten the\Nchaos we just endured?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have not, but Ralaire's a\Ntotal sweetheart, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a moment, what is Ray Lair?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you named that abomination!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you and me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray plus Claire equals Ray Lair!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would disgrace my name by\Nbestowing it upon that menace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it, it's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like the root of our love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that's all the more reason\Nto have Professor Torrid kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't do that, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray Lair's a good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She even knows how to do tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:00:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roll over!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It barely moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, I'm telling the professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen the best part!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, girl. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, undeen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In miniature!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a water slime is in the\Npresence of a beautiful lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it will often assume her form, like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, is that really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinda sorta halfway true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They actually just mimic the\Nshape of whatever's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a type of camouflage they\Nuse to protect themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No harm in Miss Claire believing\Nthe beautiful lady part, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fascinating ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it is rather endearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not have the\Ncreature done away with,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in return you are responsible\Nfor teaching it proper discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very kindly, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shall be done post-haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no sneaking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll reveal its existence to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lastly, the name Ray\NLaher simply won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need to come up with a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, ship sailed on that one, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning what? Well, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a familiar never forgets its name, so once\Nyou give it one, there's no going back.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.83,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs45\fn00359\blur0.5\b1\c&HFFFFFF&\frz18.57\fax0.02\fsp1\pos(1555.5,751)\1a&H14&}R a l a i r e
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little cutie will forever\Nbe known, Ralaire! I object!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my whole heart and soul!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.58,0:02:33.87,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.84,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.00,0:02:39.80,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.09,0:02:42.98,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.98,0:02:45.94,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.97,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.97,0:02:51.99,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.99,0:02:54.31,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason How do you know\Nhow to create a world that exists?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.31,0:02:58.20,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a time, you're so familiar\Nwith the thought meaning and right?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.20,0:03:00.69,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.69,0:03:02.32,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that you can tell.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.16,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not something you can tell.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.57,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thing with your mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.76,0:03:10.08,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So real.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.08,0:03:12.58,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.77,0:03:15.83,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.17,0:03:18.59,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.46,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.46,0:03:26.70,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how it's going to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.34,0:03:29.31,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right back.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.31,0:03:33.10,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.10,0:03:38.06,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.06,0:03:39.94,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.94,0:03:42.69,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.69,0:03:45.99,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.99,0:03:48.78,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.78,0:03:51.41,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.41,0:03:55.29,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up until I forget!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.29,0:03:58.13,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.41,0:03:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you!
