Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about me, feeling\Na little ignored here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I adore you in ice-clean mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is quite enough out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ladies passed, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, this was just the written exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say the practical's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a bit of recap,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Academy Knights are self-governed\Norganization within the school,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like student council,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but fancier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an elite group.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.51,0:04:48.02,Signs,Mask,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H000000&}m 110 60 l 895 60 895 475 110 475
