Dialogue: 3,0:04:43.51,0:04:48.02,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnCalibri\fs70\fsp5\c&H060606&\blur0.8\pos(1350,720)}Rae Taylor\NMisha Jur\NThane Bauer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only those who pass the rigorous\Nentrance exams are admitted,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the competition is mega fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took the exam as well, Misha?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were interested\Nin joining the Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire asked me to apply for a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said Ray needed a guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner, I want a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you fail today's practical\Nexam, you will leave this academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, I do not want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And again, I insist you think it\Nover for more than one second!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, if that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we compete under the same\Nterms as last time to keep it simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to deceive\Nme again, you trickster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shucks, you remembered, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, how about we just\Nagree if I fail, then you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I pass, then I win,\Nnice and straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be more straightforward\Nto say that if I pass, I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That puts me at too great a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both know you're going\Nto pass with flying colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, seems you aren't totally oblivious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, if you win, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You agree to do one thing I say, just\Nlike you did in our previous arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:05:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:05:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this the familiar\NI've been hearing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you pass the first test, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the knight's captain, Lorek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other guy is his vice\Ncaptain. Now moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to phase two head on outside\Nfor the practical exam
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,welcome to today's main event recruits\Nit's time for one-on-one mock battles there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are 10 rounds and our survey says the most
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anticipated are the first battle\NBane Bauer vs. Hugh Bauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sixth battle, Rod\NBauer vs. Misha George.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the tenth battle, Claire\NFrancois vs. Ray Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This special barrier will reduce\Nthe amount of damage taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So no holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight with all your strength\Nand no reservations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, will our first\Ncombatants please step forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do try and go easy on\Nme, won't you, Thane?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be safe, Prince Dane.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be safe, Prince Yu. Prince v.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince action is a great\Nway to open the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combatants ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Prince Dane\Nis on the offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an advanced user of win magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He takes an attribute normally\Nused for support and manipulates
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it to boost his strength in\Nthe style of a magic warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you want to win,\Nbut try not to be reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can lead to mistakes and you wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to hurt your\Nprecious baby brother now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Yu is so versatile\Nwith his attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using the water to\Ndeflect Prince Lane's attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time we put\Nsome distance between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he tries to get near,\Nhe'll slip on the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's bad news for a close-range\Nfighter like Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I believe\Nit's my turn to counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An intermediate water magic user,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Yu has more than a\Nfew tricks up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder people\Ncall him the Ice Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.68,0:08:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Thane, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Thane deflects the icicles with\Na wall of wind, and now in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,head on towards his opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely he'll slip on the ice! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's compressing the\Nair and walking on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:08:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice filler!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Thane is trapped\Nin a prison of ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His windwall won't help\Nhim out of this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All these shards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I yield the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first battle is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winner is Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make for a worthy\Nopponent as always, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do as well, though\NI suspect you held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You use ice and water,\Nbut no healing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Thane, you're so gallant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody looks cool in a magic battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five battles down, on to the sixth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, sick of Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, she's not very enthused, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I really blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, who would be excited\Nabout going up against Prince Rod?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back, Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you the very best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for this\Nopportunity, Prince Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, you don't need to be so polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll just force you to do\Nyour best if that's what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you don't mind some extra company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet my minions, the flame troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are so many! Aw,\Nthey're cute! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The minions have taken the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things look dire for Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How will she respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that sound? Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The minions have all disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world did she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.08,0:10:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like fingernails on a jog board!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner, you heard it as well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Misha wields her wind magic offensively,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,channeling it into a sound\Nto strike her chosen target.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The technique is called siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What immense firepower!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see how she can\Ncome back from this. Misha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She appears completely unscathed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that another wind magic technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Vacuum Rupture.
