Dialogue: 3,0:11:49.14,0:11:49.18,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{=3}{\fn00403\fs50\fsp3\c&H000000&\bord0\blur0.6\pos(260,845)}Flask\NInterior
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're tougher than I expected. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.36,0:11:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Rod unleashes a barrage of minions!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One strike after another, classic Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Rod's aptitude for fire\Nmagic is only intermediate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he has an exceptional\Namount of magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a match between students, he\Nseems to be taking things a bit far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he keeps this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I yield the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.14,0:12:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a victor! Misha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did she collapse like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Low oxygen. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Rod's nonstop attacks\Nand her continuous use
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of vacuum rupture depleted\Nher body of the oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it needs to function properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put it simply,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:13:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Misha was overwhelmed by the sheer\Nvolume of magic he threw at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Misha, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went too far, brother. Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should take her to the nurse's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, folks, this year's mat exam may be\Nthe most exciting one we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's still one battle left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to win this for sure, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blair! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not coming or what you're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're in for\Na pretty good show here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combatants ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 10th battle is Claire\NFrancois versus Ray Taylor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, hooray, Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we're done here, I will\Npersonally read you your last rites.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me duking it out should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun, did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a humiliating defeat\Nis your idea of leisure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day's final battle starts now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither of the combatants are moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a contest if\Nyou just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but the view from here is so lovely,\NI can't bring myself to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cease your mockery and\Nfight me, you cretin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting on a little old\Nme to make the first move?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray has summoned a rock wall,\Ncompletely encasing her opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the effective barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She broke the rock? No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She appears to have melted it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takes some real heat to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the fire attribute\Nis strong against Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but even so, I didn't\Nrealize it could melt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I'll have\Nto up my game a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A shield made entirely of fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since flames aren't solid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a wall of them isn't usually\Neffective as a means of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if they're hot enough to melt stone\Ninstantly, that changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her style of controlling\Nand expertly manipulating
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fire is why Miss Claire is\Nknown as the Red Lotus Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.10,0:15:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're quite finished,\NI believe it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, behold the artistic\Nmagic of a noble! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roar more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's using flamelands?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is it hot in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your magic is a work of art\Njust like you are, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll melt through this flimsy\Nwall just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's made up a different\Nmaterial than the last one was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what could have forstood that attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tungsten carbide, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about twice as strong as steel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and its melting point is\Nover 2,000 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got all this knowledge\Nfrom my previous life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit, unlike your character,\Nyour craft is quite disciplined.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, I'm afraid you're\Nstill no match for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Claire is using\Nflamelance once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time she's going\Nbigger! Much bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.46,0:16:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that twerp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From flamelance into a fireball fuselage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a remarkable control technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rey shot down every one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still putting up a good fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She managed to get every single\None with that little time to react?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With no missteps at all. How odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if she anticipated\Nall of Claire's moves. Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rey spends every waking moment\Nthinking about her beloved Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not even gonna try to deny that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've memorized every last detail\Nof Miss Claire's combat style.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bested by a commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admiring my work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you giving up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies, Prince Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems she's copying\Nyour fire troop minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wall appears to be holding\Nagainst this latest barrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see why she'd want to copy me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Claire doesn't have the magic\Npower to keep that up for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't imagine that will be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If her tactic is what I suspect,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's seeking to deprive Ray of oxygen,\Nin which case she will not need long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray continues to focus on defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defense becomes offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Claire can't escape,\Nthat'll be the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as if I would fall\Nfor the same trick twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now she's busting out the gymnastics!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intelligence and\Nathleticism in one package.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're planning to do\Nfrom up there, but I can't wait to find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impudent wretch, you're too\Ncocky for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined I would deploy\Nthis against a mere commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the Fran Family Crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was only a warning shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, Magic Ray is far\Nstronger than my other techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much so that even I can\Nonly wield it so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would be wise to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that I probably can't dodge that\Nonce I see it starting so you yield then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but stubbornness\Nis my biggest pitfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly of all the spells you could use\Nyou pick that one one more for giggles!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once was undignified and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey down there, you think\Nyou can make it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and you're going\Nto be sorry when I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait, I can easily widen this hole\Nusing magic. It's time to give up, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Thane?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why should I surrender\Nwhen I'm still able to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that\NRey is a dual caster?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, she hasn't used\Nher water magic at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it would have been much\Nmore effective against your fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been holding back\Nthe entire battle? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mocking me again, you—Away,\Nsorry, Miss Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but given the situation I must step\Nin and call the match to a halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winner is Ray Taylor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an inspiration to us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As before, the results of the exam\Nwill be Posted on the bulletin board!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your name is listed,\Nthen you've made the cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The newest members of The knights\Nare Prince Rod, Prince Yu,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Dane, the commoner,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Misha, and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I forget to tell you how\Nthe practical exam is scored?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What counts in your\Nevaluation is raw talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.28,0:21:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether you win or lose has\Nno bearing on the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.78,0:21:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.69,0:21:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what you\Ntwo do when you work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try not to burn down the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So looks like I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the deal was that\Nyou only get one request.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you demand this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just promise me again\Nthat you won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't understand\Nwhat you're playing at.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the exact same\Nthing you wanted before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is, so go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swear it again, and we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby swear before God that I,\NClaire Francois, will never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\NI will not abandon hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I promise to continue\Nfighting until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you truly certain that's all? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like there's\Nsomething I'm forgetting?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I to do with this?
