Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a little bit of a cliche, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.94,0:23:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.70,0:23:12.93,ed_eng_05_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}No matter how much I bully you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.93,0:23:14.27,ed_eng_05_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It doesn't bother you at all...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.27,0:23:15.14,ed_eng_05_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}How infuriating!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.14,0:23:16.81,ed_eng_05_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Dear God, I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.81,0:23:17.98,ed_eng_05_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I'll make sure you understand my words:
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.98,0:23:20.77,ed_eng_05_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Joy, gratitude, appreciation, happiness...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.77,0:23:22.11,ed_eng_05_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I wanna express everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.11,0:23:22.90,ed_eng_05_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}You see,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.90,0:23:24.61,ed_eng_05_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Even if it's for a minute or just a second,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.61,0:23:25.61,ed_eng_05_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I wanna be by your side!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.80,0:23:31.76,ed_eng_05_pink,Ralaire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.76,0:23:35.73,ed_eng_05_pink,Ralaire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There has been no one like you in my world
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.73,0:23:39.73,ed_eng_05_pink,Ralaire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So I'll make sure you know this:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you want to say something\Nlike this, I want to be like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.73,0:23:41.48,ed_eng_05_pink,Ralaire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}No matter when or where,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.48,0:23:44.65,ed_eng_05_pink,Ralaire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}I want to be right in front of you!
